/308067518587824403498b2e43d91979.mp4?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-Farmer Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemy farmers in different game modes that change the way you play. Chase a chicken around the map in Chicken Run, steal the enemy’s prized pig in Capture The Pig, defend the scarecrow in King of the Crow, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/355b90ed673398bf24ace70693ad0c6f.poster.avif?t=1776188063\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/355b90ed673398bf24ace70693ad0c6f.webm?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/355b90ed673398bf24ace70693ad0c6f.mp4?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive The Horde</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle zombies in Horde Mode where you take on waves of infected farmers and animals. Can you survive to the end and take on the final boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/709735ac62d207255d7e383fdca5a936.poster.avif?t=1776188063\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/709735ac62d207255d7e383fdca5a936.webm?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/709735ac62d207255d7e383fdca5a936.mp4?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
